      },
      "lineNbr": 1725,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-05T07:46:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "More realistically the best thing to do is probably to lock, make a copy, unlock and then iterate on the copy.",
