      "writtenOn": "2019-03-05T08:22:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "reportUpstreamChanged would always be called under the mPublicSync lock. Looks I need to add the comment for this. See line 1238~1244 and line 1428 ~1433, mTetherUpstream and reportUpstreamChanged() should be protected by same synchronized at the same time. This is why I don\u0027t lock mPublicSync inner reportUpstreamChanged function.",
